sequenceDiagram
  %% Import in draw.io: Arrange > Insert > Advanced > Mermaid
  %% Sequence: Seller uploads an asset and admin moderates it

  actor Seller
  participant UI as Marketplace UI
  participant API as Express API
  participant Auth as Auth/RBAC Middleware
  participant Upload as Upload Service
  participant Storage as Supabase Storage
  participant AssetRepo as Asset Repository
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  actor Admin
  participant Notif as Notification Service

  Seller->>UI: Fill upload form and submit files
  UI->>API: POST /api/upload + asset metadata
  API->>Auth: Verify JWT and upload_asset permission
  Auth-->>API: Authorized seller
  API->>Upload: Validate file types and metadata
  Upload->>Storage: Store files and thumbnails
  Storage-->>Upload: Public/private file URLs
  Upload->>AssetRepo: createAsset(status = pending)
  AssetRepo->>DB: INSERT assets, formats, tags
  DB-->>AssetRepo: Created asset
  AssetRepo-->>API: Asset DTO
  API->>Notif: Notify admins of pending asset
  API-->>UI: Upload accepted, pending moderation

  Admin->>UI: Open moderation queue
  UI->>API: PATCH /api/admin/assets/:id/status
  API->>Auth: Verify moderate_content permission
  Auth-->>API: Authorized admin/employee
  API->>AssetRepo: Update asset status and reason
  AssetRepo->>DB: UPDATE assets SET status, moderated_by, moderated_at
  DB-->>AssetRepo: Updated asset
  API->>Notif: Notify seller of approval/rejection
  API-->>UI: Moderation result

